&lt;h1 id=&quot;conclusion&quot;&gt;Conclusion&lt;a class=&quot;zola-anchor&quot; href=&quot;#conclusion&quot; aria-label=&quot;Anchor link for: conclusion&quot; style=&quot;visibility: hidden;&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A proper factory reset doesn&#39;t just delete data, it also ensures the data is overwritten first so the old data can&#39;t be recovered. Filling the device with random data, deleting it and then performing a standard reset, you significantly reduce the risk of data leakage. It just adds another layer of security before handing off your phone or selling it.&lt;/p&gt;
